%% Title: Evidence export sequence and commit boundary
%% Evidence: code-backed execution order; provider verified = false; release accepted = false
%% Primary objects: 8
sequenceDiagram
  participant LA as Log Analytics
  participant DR as Detection rule
  participant M as Monitoring
  participant N as Notifications
  participant F as Function
  participant V as Vault
  participant S as checkpoint/DLQ
  participant H as Splunk HEC
  LA->>DR: telemetry: saved search evaluates bounded window
  DR-->>M: telemetry: numeric metric and dimensions
  M-->>N: control: reviewed alarm transition
  N-->>F: control: at-least-once invocation
  F->>S: control: load per-rule checkpoint
  F->>LA: control: query checkpoint overlap through alarm end
  LA-->>F: response: selected evidence fields
  F->>V: control: read credential reference
  V-->>F: response: runtime credential value
  F->>H: telemetry: deterministic HEC event batches
  alt HEC confirms every batch
    H-->>F: response: accepted
    F->>S: control: commit monotonic checkpoint
  else delivery fails or is quarantined
    H-->>F: response: retryable or quarantine outcome
    F->>S: control: persist remaining events without checkpoint advance
  end
